                <invention-title lang="fr">DISPOSITIF DE DÉVERROUILLAGE ET POUSSETTE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">UNLOCK DEVICE AND STROLLER</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An unlock device comprising: at least one operating member movably disposed on a frame, the frame being equipped with a first lock mechanism and a second lock mechanism; a first unlock module movably disposed on the frame and connected to the first lock mechanism; and a second unlock module movably disposed on the frame and connected to the second lock mechanism; a selecting member movably disposed on the frame, wherein the first and second unlock modules are moved with the selecting member, and the at least one operating member is able to move to drive the first unlock module to unlock the first lock mechanism or drive the second unlock module to unlock the second lock mechanism.</p>
            </abstract>
